	(text_box "WHY THE 74LVC1G80\nThe simplest D flip-flop there is: D, CLK,\n~Q and the two rails, and nothing else. No\npreset and no clear, so there is no\nasynchronous input that could reset a\nsampler which must never be reset, and\nnothing to tie off.\nSame 74LVC family and the same SOT-23-5\nfootprint as the squarer and the Schmitt, so\nthe whole board is one package type at\nassembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
